# Testing
# Cassettes are committed so the integration and network suites replay offline on a
# fresh clone. Ignore stray/scratch recordings, but track the ones the suites need.
tests/fixtures/cassettes/*
!tests/fixtures/cassettes/.gitkeep
!tests/fixtures/cassettes/e2e-*
!tests/fixtures/cassettes/error-*
!tests/fixtures/cassettes/vat-rates-*

